{"id":"1ba06d052a6e99dd","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-order7-successor-set.md","title":"ZFC Order7 Successor Set","display":"df-zfc-order7-successor-set — ZFC Order7 Successor Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order7-successor-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order7-successor-set"],"display":"df-zfc-order7-successor-set — ZFC Order7 Successor Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order7-successor-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order7-successor-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order7-successor-set — ZFC Order7 Successor Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R,S_0\\in V\">\\(X,R,S_0\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)\\)</span> (poset predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7SuccessorSet}_S(X,R,x,S_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7SuccessorSet}_S(X,R,x,S_0)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}successor\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7SuccessorSet}_S(X,R,x,S_0)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)\\land x\\in X\\land S_0=\\{y\\in X\\mid\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land y\\neq x\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}successor\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7SuccessorSet}_S(X,R,x,S_0)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)\\land x\\in X\\land S_0=\\{y\\in X\\mid\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land y\\neq x\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the strict upper cone of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> in a typed poset. It is intentionally distinct from the immediate-successor set, which would additionally exclude elements strictly between <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,R,S_0\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7SuccessorSet}_S(X,R,x,S_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}successor\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7SuccessorSet}_S(X,R,x,S_0)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)\\land x\\in X\\land S_0=\\{y\\in X\\mid\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land y\\neq x\\}","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false}],"bytes":932,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2959","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-order7-successor-set.md|58-df-zfc-order7-successor-set]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}